  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "macos-setup.sh: Set --build for x86_64 GMP build.",
  "description": "Without specifying a CPU family, the GMP configure script configures for the\nCPU type of the build host.  This can break things for users with older Intel\nCPUs when we have a builder with a newer CPU.\n\nFor x86_64, set \"nehalem\" as the CPU architecture, since that's the oldest CPU\narchitecture supported by the oldest version of macOS we presently support.\nSince Apple is no longer using Intel CPUs, this can probably remain as-is until\nwe stop building for Intel Mac.\n\nTidy up a few comments.\n\nFixes #20348.",
  "state": "merged",
